category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libssl-devel
sdesc: "Small but powerful library implementing the client-server IRC protocol (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Libircclient is a small but extremely powerful library which implements the
client IRC protocol. It is designed to be small, fast, portable and compatible
with the RFC standards as well as non-standard but popular features. It is
perfect for building the IRC clients and bots."
skip:

homepage: https://www.ulduzsoft.com/libircclient/
license: LGPL-2.0-or-later OR LGPL-3.0-or-later
